WEBVTT

01:33.360 --> 01:35.631
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.691 --> 01:37.991
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.060 --> 01:40.961
(Episode 29)

01:45.601 --> 01:46.801
Aunt, Uncle.

01:47.000 --> 01:47.870
Qin Qin, you're back.

01:48.000 --> 01:48.670
Come on.

01:48.741 --> 01:49.441
Dinner is ready.

01:50.640 --> 01:52.541
Song Yan didn't even eat...

01:52.741 --> 01:53.980
and went back to his brigade in such a hurry.

01:54.081 --> 01:54.810
Seriously.

01:56.610 --> 01:57.280
Where's Zhai Miao?

01:57.780 --> 01:58.450
She went back to school.

02:00.450 --> 02:02.090
Shouldn't she be looking for a job now?

02:02.521 --> 02:03.250
Yes.

02:03.321 --> 02:04.620
I wonder how it turned out.

02:05.961 --> 02:06.661
Here.

02:07.360 --> 02:08.021
I can help myself.

02:08.090 --> 02:08.991
It's nothing, my child.

02:09.291 --> 02:10.260
Let me get it for you.

02:10.331 --> 02:11.291
Don't be shy.

02:13.260 --> 02:13.931
Is this enough?

02:14.000 --> 02:15.131
Yes, thank you, Uncle.

02:15.200 --> 02:15.870
Girls don't eat much.

02:15.931 --> 02:16.600
Eat more.

02:17.301 --> 02:18.901
You have to try these chicken wings.

02:18.970 --> 02:19.771
I marinated them for two hours.

02:19.840 --> 02:20.771
They're very flavorful.

02:20.901 --> 02:21.570
Okay.

02:22.671 --> 02:23.540
Thank you, Aunt.

02:24.440 --> 02:25.141
You're welcome.

02:25.380 --> 02:26.280
We made them especially for you.

02:26.611 --> 02:27.581
They're made with so much care.

02:27.840 --> 02:29.511
Why isn't anyone serving me?

02:30.181 --> 02:30.910
I'm sorry.

02:31.181 --> 02:32.250
I forgot about it.

02:32.521 --> 02:33.521
I was focused on her.

02:37.090 --> 02:38.021
It's very delicious.

02:38.090 --> 02:38.820
It's good, right?

02:39.060 --> 02:39.790
All right.

02:39.861 --> 02:41.391
I'll eat less.

02:41.461 --> 02:42.630
Although you don't look slim based on your face,

02:42.690 --> 02:43.630
you're so skinny.

02:43.690 --> 02:45.130
- Eat more. - Save it.

02:45.201 --> 02:46.201
Qin Qin, eat more.

02:46.261 --> 02:47.301
Qin Qin is so skinny.

02:48.130 --> 02:49.600
Qin Qin, do you want a drink?

02:50.231 --> 02:51.231
Drink a bit.

02:51.570 --> 02:52.370
I'll get the glass.

02:52.440 --> 02:53.771
Your uncle is looking for a drinking buddy.

02:55.810 --> 02:56.511
I'll drink a little then.

02:56.570 --> 02:57.241
Okay.

02:58.070 --> 02:59.440
Where's mine?

03:00.410 --> 03:01.850
This is so embarrassing. I forgot about you again.

03:02.711 --> 03:04.151
Am I invisible to you?

03:04.211 --> 03:05.720
Let's drink together.

03:06.951 --> 03:07.651
Here.

03:09.290 --> 03:10.451
Don't pour too much for her.

03:10.521 --> 03:11.220
Okay.

03:11.320 --> 03:11.991
That's enough.

03:12.060 --> 03:12.720
- Thank you, Uncle. - Okay.

03:12.861 --> 03:13.590
Pour more for me.

03:13.660 --> 03:14.320
Okay.

03:16.290 --> 03:17.590
We're happy today. Let's drink.

03:17.660 --> 03:18.331
Yes.

03:20.630 --> 03:21.331
Here.

03:21.401 --> 03:22.201
- Here. - Let's drink.

03:23.000 --> 03:23.931
I wish you happiness.

03:24.401 --> 03:25.070
Thank you.

03:25.141 --> 03:25.940
Have a baby soon.

03:26.840 --> 03:27.940
It's too early to say that.

03:28.410 --> 03:29.340
I'm just kidding.

03:30.011 --> 03:30.840
Here.

03:33.981 --> 03:34.810
It's good.

04:02.570 --> 04:03.570
Mr. Meng.

04:03.671 --> 04:05.581
If there's nothing else,

04:05.641 --> 04:06.940
I'll get off work first.

04:08.810 --> 04:09.810
Regarding Haoqi's project,

04:10.380 --> 04:11.780
follow up on its progress tomorrow.

04:12.081 --> 04:12.750
Okay.

04:12.820 --> 04:13.481
Go on.

04:52.121 --> 04:53.891
(I forgot to tell you.)

04:53.961 --> 04:56.461
(You broke my little vase when you came to my house last time.)

07:04.951 --> 07:05.821
Aren't we leaving?

07:07.920 --> 07:08.961
I'm used to being the first one to arrive...

07:09.730 --> 07:10.490
and the last one to leave.

07:12.401 --> 07:14.131
You don't like being in a crowd.

07:15.901 --> 07:16.930
I didn't break...

07:18.131 --> 07:19.701
the vase at your house when I was drunk, did I?

07:30.180 --> 07:30.951
No.

07:33.821 --> 07:35.350
I'll take a taxi home.

07:35.420 --> 07:36.251
I'll drive you home.

07:38.251 --> 07:39.360
There are so many people outside.

07:40.621 --> 07:41.521
You won't be able to get a cab.

07:45.761 --> 07:47.430
That vase isn't worth much.

07:47.961 --> 07:49.071
It's worth less than one-tenth...

07:49.131 --> 07:50.100
of this ticket's price.

07:50.930 --> 07:52.040
Whether it's valuable or not...

07:52.501 --> 07:53.501
has nothing to do with me.

07:54.340 --> 07:56.011
After all, I didn't break the vase.

07:57.610 --> 07:58.340
Then...

07:58.540 --> 07:59.941
Then why did you invite me to this concert?

08:01.910 --> 08:02.850
Someone is not coming anymore.

08:03.711 --> 08:04.680
The seat is empty anyway.

08:10.220 --> 08:11.290
Then who was this ticket...

08:11.761 --> 08:12.920
originally for?

08:22.401 --> 08:24.530
Since you treated me to a concert,

08:24.800 --> 08:26.441
I'll treat you to a live house performance.

08:28.740 --> 08:29.540
I'm not interested.

08:32.340 --> 08:33.141
That's right.

08:33.840 --> 08:35.811
It's what young people like us prefer.

08:38.980 --> 08:39.920
Your provocation...

08:40.721 --> 08:41.680
doesn't work on me.

08:43.450 --> 08:44.151
I know.

08:45.221 --> 08:47.420
Actually, it has nothing to do with whether you're young or not.

08:48.190 --> 08:50.131
It's just that some people are cold.

08:50.560 --> 08:52.131
They look like they don't have much energy.

08:53.530 --> 08:54.930
That sounds like you.

08:56.030 --> 08:57.200
Even though you're young,

08:58.001 --> 08:59.440
you don't look like you have much energy.

09:04.371 --> 09:05.341
You can see for yourself.

09:06.841 --> 09:07.611
I can.

09:08.881 --> 09:09.651
But that's not necessary.

09:18.591 --> 09:19.261
Hey.

09:19.320 --> 09:20.660
Why aren't you in the dorm?

09:20.761 --> 09:21.591
Didn't we agree...

09:21.660 --> 09:23.330
to pick the photos and write the article tonight?

09:23.391 --> 09:25.660
I called you 7 or 8 times and you didn't pick up.

09:25.960 --> 09:27.101
I'll be right back.

09:27.530 --> 09:28.460
Where did you go?

09:28.530 --> 09:29.570
You didn't even tell me in advance.

09:30.771 --> 09:31.940
I'll be back soon.

09:37.471 --> 09:38.371
You're going back to school, right?

09:40.011 --> 09:40.680
Let's go.

09:40.741 --> 09:44.651
(Concert Hall)

10:40.341 --> 10:41.570
Do you love the symphony?

10:42.741 --> 10:43.570
It's all right.

10:44.141 --> 10:45.410
If I see an orchestra I like,

10:46.180 --> 10:46.981
I'll go and listen to it.

10:48.780 --> 10:50.981
I used to think that symphonies were too elegant.

10:51.251 --> 10:52.621
I thought I wouldn't understand it.

10:53.420 --> 10:54.981
I didn't expect that after experiencing it today,

10:55.050 --> 10:56.221
it's really quite nice.

10:56.920 --> 10:57.651
Thank you.

10:59.091 --> 10:59.761
It's nothing.

11:01.930 --> 11:03.060
Do you play an instrument?

11:03.960 --> 11:04.761
What do you think?

11:05.330 --> 11:06.030
I think you do.

11:06.660 --> 11:07.731
You seem like the type...

11:07.800 --> 11:09.131
who can play an instrument since you were little.

11:09.901 --> 11:10.700
Why?

11:10.930 --> 11:11.700
Your aura.

11:16.810 --> 11:17.641
So, do you?

11:19.440 --> 11:20.111
Indeed.

11:21.410 --> 11:22.450
I played when I was young.

11:23.080 --> 11:23.810
The piano?

11:24.611 --> 11:25.521
And cello.

11:27.420 --> 11:28.651
Are you the gifted type?

11:29.351 --> 11:30.721
Don't kids learn to play instruments...

11:32.091 --> 11:33.660
because their parents like them?

11:36.060 --> 11:37.131
Actually,

11:37.560 --> 11:39.401
I'm quite envious of people who can play instruments.

11:40.160 --> 11:42.430
During recitals in my school,

11:42.771 --> 11:44.501
I think girls who can play instruments...

11:44.570 --> 11:45.540
are especially charming on stage.

11:46.501 --> 11:48.040
Although it's hard to learn it when you're little,

11:48.601 --> 11:50.271
it's a talent.

11:51.641 --> 11:52.410
A talent...

11:52.741 --> 11:54.981
just to be performed in recitals?

11:57.280 --> 11:58.310
Maybe it's because I couldn't afford to learn it...

11:58.381 --> 11:59.721
when I was little.

12:00.221 --> 12:01.251
That's why I'm jealous.

12:01.721 --> 12:03.351
Don't people always long for something...

12:03.420 --> 12:04.550
that they can't have?

12:04.950 --> 12:06.121
Even if that thing...

12:06.891 --> 12:08.190
isn't necessarily beautiful.

12:15.601 --> 12:16.300
Did I...

12:16.830 --> 12:18.430
say something wrong?

12:18.940 --> 12:19.641
No.

12:21.241 --> 12:22.371
We're almost at your school.

12:22.810 --> 12:24.241
I'll stop at the intersection ahead.

12:44.690 --> 12:45.361
Hello?

12:46.131 --> 12:46.960
Are you still up?

12:48.901 --> 12:49.731
How did you know?

12:50.430 --> 12:51.300
I assumed...

12:51.570 --> 12:52.641
you weren't asleep,

12:52.940 --> 12:54.141
so I wanted to call you and see.

12:55.410 --> 12:56.210
What's wrong?

12:56.471 --> 12:57.341
Are you not used to it?

12:57.940 --> 12:58.611
A little.

13:02.011 --> 13:02.780
Are you sad?

13:04.251 --> 13:05.180
No.

13:06.080 --> 13:06.881
I didn't expect this...

13:07.050 --> 13:08.280
to happen so suddenly either.

13:09.151 --> 13:10.891
Otherwise, I can stay at home with you for a while,

13:11.450 --> 13:12.420
so you'll get used to it.

13:13.920 --> 13:14.861
I'm fine.

13:15.391 --> 13:17.361
It's not the first time I've met Uncle and Aunt.

13:17.690 --> 13:19.731
Besides, they used to like me a lot too.

13:21.361 --> 13:22.830
They still like you a lot now.

13:26.200 --> 13:27.570
What did you do tonight?

13:30.170 --> 13:31.040
Cleaning up.

13:31.771 --> 13:32.540
Organizing training.

13:32.780 --> 13:33.540
Reading.

13:34.580 --> 13:35.280
You're not aware, are you?

13:36.210 --> 13:37.310
Xiao Meng performed excellently.

13:37.511 --> 13:38.651
He and his teacher...

13:38.710 --> 13:39.521
both received commendations.

13:39.580 --> 13:41.121
That dog is smart.

13:41.381 --> 13:42.450
He knows he made a contribution,

13:42.721 --> 13:44.420
so he's always wagging his tail and holding his head high.

13:44.491 --> 13:45.560
He's so arrogant.

13:46.891 --> 13:48.261
I'll teach him a lesson these days.

13:48.891 --> 13:50.330
Did you name him Xiao Meng...

13:50.391 --> 13:51.530
because of me?

13:52.300 --> 13:53.131
What do you think?

13:53.861 --> 13:55.001
It can only be because of me.

13:55.901 --> 13:57.131
Otherwise, you're dead.

14:08.580 --> 14:10.180
Why are you still up so late?

14:13.381 --> 14:14.550
I'm not used to it either.

14:15.251 --> 14:17.021
You've been recuperating at home for too long.

14:17.621 --> 14:19.091
I left you alone at home.

14:22.361 --> 14:23.160
Why are you laughing?

14:28.001 --> 14:29.401
Right now, my pillow...

14:30.371 --> 14:31.300
and bed...

14:32.841 --> 14:34.001
are filled with your scent.

14:40.780 --> 14:42.111
Okay, I won't tease you anymore.

14:42.180 --> 14:43.111
I'm going to sleep.

14:43.381 --> 14:44.111
Okay.

14:45.881 --> 14:47.381
I'll be busy with work.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.091
I won't have time to text you.

14:49.920 --> 14:50.820
Don't think too much.

14:51.121 --> 14:51.851
When I'm free,

14:51.950 --> 14:52.920
I'll contact you.

14:54.460 --> 14:55.190
All right.

14:56.491 --> 14:57.231
Good girl.

16:39.861 --> 16:40.601
Get in.

16:43.771 --> 16:44.601
Get in.

17:04.251 --> 17:05.491
Did you go home yesterday?

17:07.420 --> 17:08.190
No.

17:09.731 --> 17:11.060
Mom called and told me.

17:12.460 --> 17:13.260
What did she say?

17:13.460 --> 17:14.401
That because of Song Yan,

17:16.230 --> 17:17.401
you broke ties with the family.

17:18.430 --> 17:20.041
I didn't break ties with them.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.371
I didn't.

17:22.871 --> 17:24.811
I'll visit Mom and Dad every week.

17:27.480 --> 17:28.410
Why are you laughing?

17:28.781 --> 17:30.851
Do you still not know the kind of person Mom is?

17:31.980 --> 17:33.621
Why would you still have such fantasies?

17:36.121 --> 17:37.051
What should I do then?

17:38.321 --> 17:39.321
Every week...

17:39.891 --> 17:41.690
Even if you go back every day,

17:41.861 --> 17:42.660
it's useless.

17:43.061 --> 17:44.061
Accomplishing seemingly impossible things...

17:44.331 --> 17:45.801
through sustained effort...

17:46.331 --> 17:48.531
won't happen to Ms. Fu Wen Ying.

17:49.901 --> 17:51.301
Since you chose Song Yan,

17:52.031 --> 17:53.571
it's the same as breaking ties with the family.

17:54.770 --> 17:56.041
What do you want me to do then?

17:56.770 --> 17:57.740
Do you want me to break up with him...

17:57.970 --> 17:58.940
and go back and beg for forgiveness?

17:59.940 --> 18:00.641
To be honest,

18:01.141 --> 18:01.881
no.

18:03.210 --> 18:03.910
Then...

18:04.480 --> 18:05.450
Are you on my...

18:05.510 --> 18:06.281
I'm not either.

18:17.190 --> 18:17.990
Are you happy?

18:19.930 --> 18:21.160
I'm happy...

18:21.901 --> 18:23.101
when I'm with him indeed.

18:27.770 --> 18:28.740
I mean,

18:29.170 --> 18:30.410
after leaving our parents' house...

18:30.541 --> 18:31.311
and moving out,

18:31.371 --> 18:32.980
are you happy during this time?

18:33.410 --> 18:34.710
Parental factors aside,

18:34.881 --> 18:36.180
I wasn't unhappy.

18:38.480 --> 18:39.651
But you weren't really happy either.

18:40.381 --> 18:42.020
I'm happy when I'm with him.

18:44.621 --> 18:46.160
Let's see how long you can be happy like this.

18:46.220 --> 18:46.920
You...

18:51.531 --> 18:52.700
I'm right, aren't I?

18:53.700 --> 18:54.930
That's why you're so angry.

18:56.730 --> 18:57.531
Stop the car.

18:57.601 --> 18:58.331
I want to get off.

18:58.801 --> 18:59.970
You can wait.

19:17.750 --> 19:18.450
Yan Chen.

19:20.891 --> 19:22.660
Can you talk to Mom for me?

19:22.960 --> 19:23.960
Convince her for me.

19:24.690 --> 19:25.660
How is that possible?

19:26.260 --> 19:28.200
Are you so in love that your head is full of bubbles?

19:29.301 --> 19:30.430
How could she listen to me?

19:30.730 --> 19:32.641
Whether she listens or not, give it a try first.

19:33.101 --> 19:34.571
You've asked the wrong person.

19:35.811 --> 19:37.041
Even if she really listens to me,

19:38.470 --> 19:39.680
I won't help you.

19:40.081 --> 19:40.740
You...

19:47.581 --> 19:48.321
Meng Qin.

19:48.920 --> 19:50.490
Do you act this way with our parents?

19:51.091 --> 19:51.920
Meng Yan Chen.

19:52.420 --> 19:54.690
You're happy to see me so discomposed, aren't you?

19:54.960 --> 19:56.361
You've got the one you love.

19:57.990 --> 19:59.361
What's there to be discomposed about?

20:05.531 --> 20:06.240
Close the door.

20:37.200 --> 20:39.131
How I wish you were happy too.

20:39.770 --> 20:40.841
Don't be so repressed.

20:41.770 --> 20:43.341
I want you to be happy.

20:44.071 --> 20:44.940
You will be too.

21:15.571 --> 21:18.141
(Are you going to the seven o'clock live house tonight?)

21:53.641 --> 21:54.611
Do you like it?

21:56.781 --> 21:57.680
To be honest,

21:58.081 --> 21:59.480
I don't really like it.

22:00.720 --> 22:02.621
Is it because you don't like the format?

22:04.051 --> 22:04.821
Indeed.

22:05.690 --> 22:06.760
I don't really like...

22:07.121 --> 22:08.420
this format either.

22:12.190 --> 22:13.230
Why do I get the feeling...

22:13.301 --> 22:15.031
that you don't have many hobbies?

22:17.331 --> 22:18.331
You don't look like someone...

22:18.401 --> 22:20.301
who has many hobbies.

22:24.270 --> 22:26.180
I really like organizing things.

22:27.180 --> 22:28.781
If your house is too messy,

22:28.841 --> 22:30.581
I can show you.

22:34.520 --> 22:35.821
At my house,

22:35.881 --> 22:37.821
there's no room for you to show off.

22:40.720 --> 22:43.131
You've wrapped yourself up so tightly.

22:54.301 --> 22:57.740
(Zhai Miao)

23:01.940 --> 23:02.881
I think you're polite,

23:02.950 --> 23:04.980
well-mannered, and well-spoken.

23:05.651 --> 23:06.621
But you're not willing...

23:06.680 --> 23:08.281
to tell anything about yourself at all.

23:08.381 --> 23:10.851
Instead, you find out everything about others.

23:11.351 --> 23:12.490
Look at you just now.

23:12.821 --> 23:14.561
I asked you what you like.

23:15.091 --> 23:16.091
You didn't tell me.

23:16.160 --> 23:18.160
Instead, you got information out of me.

23:19.401 --> 23:20.930
I didn't want to get information from you.

23:22.631 --> 23:25.131
Yes, I was the one who wanted to tell you.

23:27.901 --> 23:28.841
Insects.

23:30.010 --> 23:31.010
Insects?

23:31.670 --> 23:32.571
Butterflies.

23:33.781 --> 23:35.980
How are you interested in them? Do you collect them?

23:37.210 --> 23:38.551
I used to dream...

23:38.611 --> 23:40.651
about being an entomologist...

23:40.851 --> 23:42.551
who studies butterflies.

23:42.750 --> 23:44.391
Now, I have a room...

23:44.450 --> 23:45.821
dedicated to my collection...

23:45.891 --> 23:47.760
of butterfly specimens, information, and photos.

23:50.291 --> 23:51.391
Can I take a look?

24:01.670 --> 24:02.341
No.

24:04.641 --> 24:05.871
It's in my house.

24:08.641 --> 24:09.811
Okay.

24:12.180 --> 24:14.420
Why didn't you become an entomologist then?

24:17.621 --> 24:18.750
Are you doing...

24:18.920 --> 24:20.561
your dream job?

24:23.061 --> 24:24.061
No.

24:25.260 --> 24:27.101
Actually, I'm studying biology.

24:27.760 --> 24:29.571
I quite like my major.

24:30.170 --> 24:33.000
Even now, I'm looking for a job that's related to biology.

24:34.940 --> 24:36.371
But when I think about practicality,

24:36.440 --> 24:38.010
I feel quite pessimistic.

24:39.041 --> 24:39.781
What do you mean?

24:40.940 --> 24:43.311
Although I don't want to give up on my major,

24:43.381 --> 24:44.811
I'm not good at studying it.

24:44.910 --> 24:46.651
I'm not qualified to be recruited by the school.

24:47.051 --> 24:48.720
But I started my own business now.

24:48.920 --> 24:50.690
I can already earn 10,000 to 20,000 yuan a month.

24:56.190 --> 24:57.391
Is the competition fierce...

24:58.331 --> 25:00.131
in your line of work?

25:01.930 --> 25:03.031
Indeed.

25:03.631 --> 25:04.901
And after working in this industry,

25:04.970 --> 25:07.341
you'll become very concerned about your looks.

25:07.700 --> 25:09.141
I always feel that I'm not good-looking.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.541
I'm considering getting plastic surgery.

25:12.010 --> 25:13.541
Do you think I need it?

25:18.781 --> 25:19.450
Look at my double eyelids.

25:19.520 --> 25:20.520
Should I make them deeper?

25:20.581 --> 25:22.121
Or should I make my nose bridge higher?

25:46.440 --> 25:47.240
I don't know.

25:47.811 --> 25:48.510
It's up to you.

26:09.970 --> 26:10.930
You're back.

26:18.770 --> 26:19.841
I'm sorry.

26:20.381 --> 26:22.141
I was too busy at the bar tonight.

26:22.210 --> 26:23.250
It was too noisy.

26:23.410 --> 26:25.250
I didn't hear my phone in my bag.

26:25.410 --> 26:27.220
I really can't believe you.

26:27.420 --> 26:29.051
Can't you answer my calls...

26:29.121 --> 26:30.420
and reply to my texts as soon as possible?

26:30.490 --> 26:31.591
I didn't contact you to chat.

26:31.651 --> 26:32.960
I wanted to talk about work.

26:34.091 --> 26:34.920
I'm really sorry.

26:34.990 --> 26:36.690
I didn't mean to not answer your calls.

26:38.490 --> 26:40.260
I really feel like I'm the only one...

26:40.331 --> 26:41.901
who cares about this account now.

26:42.000 --> 26:43.500
You just have to take photos every day...

26:43.631 --> 26:44.730
and not worry about anything.

26:49.041 --> 26:50.240
That's right, Ye Zi.

26:50.410 --> 26:51.510
You two are working together.

26:51.571 --> 26:53.081
Try to understand each other.

26:53.410 --> 26:55.311
Besides, your job doesn't pay much per hour.

26:55.381 --> 26:56.410
It's fine to quit it.

26:56.781 --> 26:58.210
That's right, Ye Zi.

27:05.920 --> 27:06.821
All right.

27:07.260 --> 27:08.720
It's my fault this time.

27:09.061 --> 27:11.160
I'll resign from all those jobs. I'll quit.

27:11.561 --> 27:12.591
All right?

27:32.281 --> 27:33.621
Double march.

27:41.160 --> 27:41.891
Halt.

27:44.531 --> 27:45.490
Left face.

27:52.601 --> 27:53.700
Right align.

27:56.000 --> 27:57.010
Eyes front.

28:02.180 --> 28:03.381
Are you confident...

28:03.881 --> 28:05.180
about this competition?

28:05.250 --> 28:06.281
- Yes! - Yes!

28:09.351 --> 28:10.321
Relax.

28:10.950 --> 28:11.851
Do your best.

28:12.321 --> 28:13.190
I'll wait for your triumphant return.

28:13.260 --> 28:14.321
- Yes! - Yes!

28:16.361 --> 28:17.031
Go.

28:17.091 --> 28:18.131
Right face.

28:18.760 --> 28:19.531
All squads.

28:19.591 --> 28:20.260
Go one by one.

28:20.331 --> 28:21.601
Squad One, double march.

28:21.660 --> 28:22.660
Squad Two, double march.

28:22.730 --> 28:24.031
Squad Three, double march.

28:26.901 --> 28:28.871
(Professional and accurate, Heroic and tenacious)

28:47.821 --> 28:49.361
(Listen to commands)

29:30.230 --> 29:30.970
What's up?

29:31.571 --> 29:33.500
Suo Jun, look.

29:33.940 --> 29:34.940
The Defender Cup?

29:37.210 --> 29:38.170
The first place?

29:38.270 --> 29:38.940
Yes.

29:40.680 --> 29:41.611
Comrade Suo Jun.

29:41.680 --> 29:43.381
Half of this belongs to you.

29:45.581 --> 29:46.781
Then I should thank...

29:46.851 --> 29:48.750
the brilliant Chief Song.

29:50.051 --> 29:52.891
Today, when I held it again,

29:53.561 --> 29:55.361
the first thought that came to my mind...

29:56.190 --> 29:58.260
was to hold it up high with you...

29:59.061 --> 30:00.200
and share with you...

30:00.760 --> 30:02.131
the glory of Shilitai.

30:02.960 --> 30:04.371
Two trophies in eight years.

30:05.230 --> 30:06.440
As a station chief,

30:07.141 --> 30:08.740
you're already good enough.

30:09.740 --> 30:10.670
As the saying goes,

30:11.041 --> 30:12.740
there are no weak soldiers under a strong general.

30:13.541 --> 30:15.341
And you've led the new team members so well.

30:17.250 --> 30:17.910
Song Yan.

30:20.051 --> 30:21.321
You're my pride and joy.

30:22.020 --> 30:23.520
You're Shilitai's pride and joy too.

30:24.450 --> 30:25.821
Seeing you like this...

30:26.220 --> 30:27.291
makes me really happy.

30:32.331 --> 30:33.401
Do you still remember?

30:34.301 --> 30:35.430
Back then,

30:36.200 --> 30:37.831
we used to celebrate together.

30:37.901 --> 30:39.101
Save it.

30:39.301 --> 30:40.371
At the station,

30:40.541 --> 30:41.841
you have an instructor whom you have a good rapport with.

30:42.000 --> 30:42.670
At home,

30:42.740 --> 30:44.010
you have a beloved girlfriend.

30:44.611 --> 30:46.811
Why are you pretending to be sad with me?

30:47.881 --> 30:50.381
Although the instructor isn't at the station,

30:50.480 --> 30:52.480
he's still focused on his work.

30:52.581 --> 30:53.621
Not bad.

30:53.680 --> 30:55.321
You know so much gossip.

30:55.520 --> 30:56.621
Of course.

30:57.091 --> 30:58.220
Who am I?

30:58.520 --> 30:59.420
Let me tell you.

30:59.621 --> 31:01.821
I know your every move.

31:02.990 --> 31:05.091
Take a screenshot of me and the trophy.

31:05.561 --> 31:07.131
I'll keep it as a souvenir.

31:07.200 --> 31:07.901
Come on.

31:16.440 --> 31:17.470
Smile wider.

31:17.571 --> 31:18.470
Be happier.

31:20.210 --> 31:20.881
Done.

31:23.010 --> 31:23.910
I'll send it to you.

31:24.111 --> 31:25.051
Okay.

31:36.591 --> 31:37.660
The Defender Cup.

31:41.361 --> 31:44.301
You've finally fulfilled the promise we made back then.

31:45.700 --> 31:47.770
We've finally left the Defender Cup in Shilitai as well.

31:48.901 --> 31:50.071
Good job.

31:50.141 --> 31:51.270
Well done.

32:14.660 --> 32:15.401
What does this mean?

32:17.371 --> 32:18.230
What are you doing?

32:18.831 --> 32:19.631
I'm waiting for you.

32:21.000 --> 32:21.801
Let's have a round.

32:24.541 --> 32:25.611
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

32:34.781 --> 32:35.821
Do we continue...

32:36.281 --> 32:37.520
or start over?

32:39.490 --> 32:40.621
Let's finish it.

33:10.420 --> 33:14.791
(We'll go when there's a report, we'll move once we hear about it)

33:15.361 --> 33:18.861
(Team Appearance Mirror)

33:28.041 --> 33:30.670
(Safety Officer, Yancheng Firefighter)

33:58.430 --> 33:59.131
(Yancheng Firefighter)

34:22.890 --> 34:24.261
(Song Yan)

35:07.701 --> 35:09.600
Hey, I'm getting off work soon.

35:09.670 --> 35:11.241
Are you still busy?

35:11.471 --> 35:12.170
No.

35:12.571 --> 35:13.681
I was dispatched this afternoon.

35:13.741 --> 35:14.540
I just got back.

35:15.741 --> 35:16.411
I have to go.

35:16.480 --> 35:17.480
Is there a fire?

35:18.310 --> 35:19.281
It's not a fire.

35:19.381 --> 35:20.520
Don't worry. It'll be fine.

35:52.181 --> 35:52.951
(Have you eaten?)

35:53.011 --> 35:53.850
(I ate at the canteen. You've eaten too, right?)

35:53.920 --> 35:54.920
(Yes. We got dispatched earlier. I just got back. Are you home now?)

35:58.551 --> 36:01.560
(Sweet dreams.)

36:39.161 --> 36:41.531
Have you seen the list for the research team?

36:41.600 --> 36:43.201
Dr. Xu is on the waiting list...

36:43.261 --> 36:44.301
for the research team.

36:44.370 --> 36:46.031
That's to be expected.

36:46.230 --> 36:48.640
Since she joined Dr. Xu's team,

36:48.701 --> 36:50.741
even though he's a bit strict,

36:50.810 --> 36:53.170
he has included her in all the major surgeries...

36:53.241 --> 36:54.881
and cases...

36:55.341 --> 36:56.810
and taught her hands-on.

36:56.881 --> 36:58.580
Dr. Xu has improved a lot now.

36:58.781 --> 36:59.750
Is that so?

37:00.181 --> 37:01.721
Why do I think...

37:01.781 --> 37:04.221
that Dr. Xu is very demanding with her?

37:04.290 --> 37:05.520
He's also very strict.

37:06.420 --> 37:08.060
Why do I feel like...

37:08.120 --> 37:09.690
she might not get the spot this time?

37:10.091 --> 37:12.761
What do you know?

37:13.361 --> 37:14.531
What's wrong with me?

37:16.161 --> 37:17.701
Why talk about this so much?

37:17.770 --> 37:19.170
She has a strong background.

37:19.301 --> 37:20.440
It's already been decided.

37:24.440 --> 37:25.741
During the earthquake rescue,

37:26.341 --> 37:27.980
Dr. Xu did stand out.

37:28.411 --> 37:30.681
So she deserves this.

37:31.310 --> 37:32.310
I think...

37:32.381 --> 37:33.920
that's just an excuse.

37:34.321 --> 37:36.080
You can't say that.

37:36.250 --> 37:38.551
Dr. Xu is usually good.

37:38.850 --> 37:40.051
Even if she's usually quiet...

37:40.120 --> 37:41.091
and looks cold,

37:41.161 --> 37:42.491
she's serious and responsible.

37:42.960 --> 37:44.290
She doesn't kiss up to people.

37:44.361 --> 37:45.330
She doesn't beat around the bush.

37:45.390 --> 37:46.631
It's comfortable to be with her.

37:46.690 --> 37:47.431
That's right.

37:47.500 --> 37:48.201
Is that so?

37:49.031 --> 37:49.931
Then tell me.

37:50.000 --> 37:53.230
Why is Dr. Xu always giving her such a hard time?

37:53.401 --> 37:55.170
It's because the hospital is pressuring him.

37:55.241 --> 37:56.100
He has no choice.

37:56.170 --> 37:57.170
He can only bring her along.

37:57.341 --> 37:59.710
But as a professor,

37:59.770 --> 38:01.080
he still has a temper.

38:02.781 --> 38:04.310
I feel so bad for you, Dr. Yang.

38:04.381 --> 38:05.051
Don't say that.

38:05.181 --> 38:06.580
Don't say that on my behalf.

38:06.681 --> 38:07.520
I don't want the story to change...

38:07.580 --> 38:08.881
as it's being passed around by people.

38:09.250 --> 38:10.051
They'll say I, Yang Si Jia,

38:10.120 --> 38:11.290
am not as skilled as Dr. Xu...

38:11.350 --> 38:12.651
and just gossips behind her back.

38:13.661 --> 38:14.960
I'm doing this for your sake.

38:15.020 --> 38:16.420
That's enough. Okay, thank you.

38:16.491 --> 38:17.790
Don't worry about me.

38:18.190 --> 38:18.991
As for me,

38:19.131 --> 38:20.600
I'll become the deputy director.

38:20.960 --> 38:22.100
As to when it will happen,

38:22.531 --> 38:23.730
it has nothing to do with anyone.

38:42.920 --> 38:45.620
Dr. Xu, are you not driving today?

38:45.920 --> 38:48.321
Dr. Xu, why haven't you been driving lately?

38:48.821 --> 38:49.690
Riding a bike...

38:49.960 --> 38:52.060
is quite fast, but it's too cold.

38:53.661 --> 38:55.500
I don't know how to ride a bike.

38:55.560 --> 38:56.830
I'll take the subway later.

38:58.031 --> 38:59.330
We'll get going then, Dr. Xu.

38:59.401 --> 39:00.600
- Bye. - Bye.

39:05.870 --> 39:06.670
Hurry up, Dong Dong.

39:06.741 --> 39:07.440
Okay.

39:26.361 --> 39:28.060
Christine had plastic surgery again.

39:28.161 --> 39:30.131
She's so pretty.

39:30.201 --> 39:32.100
She always likes to have plastic surgery done.

39:32.500 --> 39:33.230
I think...

39:33.301 --> 39:34.841
it must be tiring for them to be influencers.

39:35.170 --> 39:37.810
And some netizens' comments are so mean.

39:37.870 --> 39:39.071
They always attack their looks.

39:39.140 --> 39:41.140
Good-looking people will become insecure too.

39:41.210 --> 39:42.781
I don't like her anymore.

39:43.281 --> 39:45.250
In the past, I found her so pretty.

39:45.611 --> 39:47.721
The more she gets plastic surgery, the more she looks like a mannequin.

39:47.781 --> 39:49.151
Look at her nose job.

39:51.520 --> 39:52.890
I don't like my idol anymore too.

40:00.060 --> 40:01.500
That guy is so handsome.

40:01.761 --> 40:03.330
Get me his WeChat ID.

40:08.571 --> 40:10.571
The numbers have been so bad lately.

40:10.640 --> 40:12.071
The number of followers is stagnant.

40:12.140 --> 40:13.270
It won't increase no matter what.

40:14.241 --> 40:17.011
But our photos and articles are pretty good.

40:17.810 --> 40:18.611
Yes.

40:18.850 --> 40:21.920
The competition is just too fierce in the beauty industry.

40:27.890 --> 40:29.560
(I'll treat you to a meal to thank you...)

40:29.620 --> 40:31.161
(for your invitation last time.)

40:32.491 --> 40:33.290
What's the matter?

40:34.361 --> 40:35.460
I'm going out later.

40:35.761 --> 40:37.431
Can you help me with my look?

40:38.971 --> 40:39.971
Are you dating?

40:41.040 --> 40:41.841
No.

40:41.901 --> 40:43.170
It's just a friend from my hometown.

40:44.170 --> 40:44.911
Hurry up.

40:44.971 --> 40:46.011
I'm going to wash my face first.

40:46.440 --> 40:47.411
Help me pick out some clothes.

40:47.480 --> 40:48.210
I'm going to wash my face.

40:48.281 --> 40:49.580
All right, go ahead.

41:03.161 --> 41:09.201
(Yancheng Grand Theater)

41:31.721 --> 41:33.551
Hello, do you have a reservation?

41:34.361 --> 41:35.821
Yes, under Mr. Meng.

41:35.890 --> 41:37.290
All right, please come with me.

41:49.940 --> 41:51.170
Help me hang up my coat.

41:52.540 --> 41:53.341
Thank you.

41:57.451 --> 41:58.681
Have you been waiting for a long time?

41:58.850 --> 42:00.580
No, I just got here.

42:01.480 --> 42:02.881
I don't know what you like to eat,

42:03.250 --> 42:04.651
so I ordered their specialties.

42:05.690 --> 42:06.620
Check the menu.

42:07.761 --> 42:09.290
Order what else you want.

42:09.920 --> 42:10.830
I'm not picky with food.

42:10.890 --> 42:11.661
Anything is fine.

42:11.991 --> 42:12.861
I didn't order wine.

42:13.161 --> 42:14.031
Is tea okay?

42:14.100 --> 42:14.801
Sure.

42:15.531 --> 42:17.370
Actually, you don't have to treat me to a meal.

42:17.431 --> 42:18.631
I invited you to the live house last time...

42:18.701 --> 42:20.741
to thank you for the concert.

42:22.401 --> 42:23.571
But you're here now.

42:23.640 --> 42:25.140
Don't they say that in this world,

42:25.210 --> 42:27.140
there are two things you can't let down?

42:27.210 --> 42:28.980
Good food is one of them.

42:29.411 --> 42:30.111
What's the other one?

42:30.181 --> 42:30.980
Love.

42:33.111 --> 42:34.250
You're making this up, aren't you?

42:35.821 --> 42:37.080
How did you know?

42:38.250 --> 42:39.591
Do you really believe...

42:39.651 --> 42:40.890
that there are things in this world...

42:41.091 --> 42:42.690
that can't be let down?

42:42.761 --> 42:43.931
Why not?
